Common SiteCoordinator
  documentation "The education site coordinator, acting on behalf of a community or educational board, providing on-site administrative coordination for an organization."
  date BeginDate
    documentation "The month, day, and year of the start or effective date of a staff member's site coordinator position for an education organization. Note: Date interpretation may vary. Ed-Fi recommends inclusive dates, but states may define dates as inclusive or exclusive. For calculations, align with local guidelines."
    is required
  date EndDate
    documentation "The month, day, and year of the end or termination date of a staff member's employment, contract, or relationship with the local education agency. Note: Date interpretation may vary. Ed-Fi recommends inclusive dates, but states may define dates as inclusive or exclusive. For calculations, align with local guidelines."
    is optional
  bool SiteCoordinator
    documentation "An indication that a staff is a site coordinator."
    is optional
